# Brand & UI

## Direction
Dark navy + champagne gold. Premium, calm, trust-first.
"Bloomberg Terminal meets Swiss private bank" — ไม่ใช่ casino/gambling aesthetic.

## Tokens (reuse, don't invent)
- CSS vars: `--background`, `--gold`, `.premium-card`, `.risk-text`
- Tailwind: `border-gold-500/30`, `text-gold-300`, `text-amber-200` for risk
- Background: `#050b18` + subtle gold radial gradients

## Copy language
- Public UI: **Thai-first** headlines and body
- CTA primary: LINE-first (`NEXT_PUBLIC_LINE_OA_URL` or `/support`)

## Components
- Site sections → `src/components/site/*`
- shadcn primitives → `src/components/ui/*`
- Content constants → `src/content/*` (not inline Lorem)

## Patterns
- Functional components, typed props
- `SectionHeader`, `ComplianceNote`, `RiskDisclosureBar` as reference
- Responsive: mobile-first (`py-20 md:py-28`, `sm:flex-row`)
